WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Narrator: Scene three.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.300
Narrator: Noura verifies both tickets, and they are the same.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.600
Narrator: She doesn't decide who is right.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:16.540
Noura: Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22. Block 112, row 14, seat 8. Two fans with tickets for the same seat, one with two children. I'm staying with them. Over.

5
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.040
Zain: Received. Replacement seat block 114, row 3. Escort them, Faisal will cover your post. Over.

6
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.580
Narrator: She radios her supervisor with where, what and who.

7
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:35.080
Narrator: When the new seat comes back, she says: 'Thank you, enjoy the game', waits for cover, escorts the family, and reports 'done'.

8
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.080 line:6% align:center
Noura: Sierra 2, escort complete, back on post. Over.

9
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.120
Narrator: Verify, coordinate, escort.
